WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.068
To report a problem with a product detail page, open the Seller Central Main menu, hover over Performance,

00:00:08.068 --> 00:00:09.412
click "Account Health".

00:00:09.412 --> 00:00:17.480
Then, in the top left-hand corner of the Account Health page, select "Report Abuse of Amazon Policies".

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:23.942
You'll see a series of reporting options in a menu on the left, including multiple options related

00:00:23.942 --> 00:00:25.420
to product detail pages.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.830
Click "Product Detail Page" violates Amazon's policies or is misleading customers.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:36.420
Then, select the option that most closely aligns with the issue you encountered.

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:43.351
You'll need to provide the ASIN attached to the product or products and a description of the problem.

00:00:43.351 --> 00:00:44.420
Then, click "Submit".

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:49.500
We will review your submission and update you when a course of action has been determined.
